{"pageid":2278,"title":"Opal","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Opal</span>","revid":14228,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"notice\" style=\"font-size:90%; width:100%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><p style=\"margin-bottom:.3em\"><span style=\"font-size:125%; font-weight:semi-bold\">Candidate for Deletion</span><br />\n<i>This article has been nominated for removal from the wiki. Reason: There are more detailed pages.<br />Remember to check <a href=\"/wiki/Special:WhatLinksHere/Opal\" title=\"Special:WhatLinksHere/Opal\"><u>what links here</u></a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Opal?action=history\"><u>the page history</u></a> before deletion.</i></p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>The <b>Opal</b> ore consists of 3 different variants, the <a href=\"/wiki/OpalRed\" title=\"OpalRed\">OpalRed</a> only growing in <a href=\"/wiki/Red_Clay\" title=\"Red Clay\">Red Clay</a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/OpalBlue\" title=\"OpalBlue\">OpalBlue</a> growing in <a href=\"/wiki/Blue_Clay\" title=\"Blue Clay\">Blue Clay</a> and the <a href=\"/wiki/OpalBrown\" title=\"OpalBrown\">OpalBrown</a> growing in <a href=\"/wiki/Brown_Clay\" title=\"Brown Clay\">Brown Clay</a>. All of them are located in Ferwater and are uncommon ores.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Opal\">Opal</span></h2>\n<table class=\"sortable fandom-table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Picture\n</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center;\">Name\n</th>\n<th>Price\n<p>(Raw)\n</p>\n</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center;\">Price\n<p>(Refined)\n</p>\n</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center;\">Price\n<p>(Forged)\n</p>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/73/RawBlOpal.png/revision/latest?cb=20240323123601\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"RawBlOpal\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/73/RawBlOpal.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/128?cb=20240323123601\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"RawBlOpal.png\" data-image-key=\"RawBlOpal.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/OpalBlue\" title=\"OpalBlue\"><b>Blue Opal</b></a>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"3\">$5/Stud\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"3\">$46/stud\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"3\">$52/stud\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/cc/RawBrOpal.png/revision/latest?cb=20240323123430\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"RawBrOpal\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/cc/RawBrOpal.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/128?cb=20240323123430\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"RawBrOpal.png\" data-image-key=\"RawBrOpal.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/OpalBrown\" title=\"OpalBrown\"><b>Brown Opal</b></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/99/RawReOpal.png/revision/latest?cb=20240323123804\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"RawReOpal\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/99/RawReOpal.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/128?cb=20240323123804\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"RawReOpal.png\" data-image-key=\"RawReOpal.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/OpalRed\" title=\"OpalRed\"><b>Red Opal</b></a>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902110952\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: f